1 NAME Khuman
2 GIVN Khuman
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 773
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Chittor emerges as the guardian of Hindu faith, Khuman emerges as its most remarkable guardian-King. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In Khuman Rasa, one of the oldest poetic chronicles of Mewar, Khuman's defence of Chittor is celebrated by the bards. In the face of formidable aggression by Muslim invaders, Khuman brings together the Rajput Kings and other Chief
2 CONC tens to put up a united defence. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He successfully defends the 'crimson standard of Mewar' , treats with contempt the demand for tribute, and after a violent assault in which the barbarian is driven back, follows and discomfits him in the plain, carrying back the h
2 CONC ostile leader," writes Col Tod.
