1 NAME Khuman II
2 GIVN Khuman II
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 853
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Khuman II is engaged in twenty-four great battles against Muslim invaders. And the name of Khuman becomes a family distinction : Khuman Gaani : invoked even today as a greeting and a blessing. "Many Salutations to 
2 CONC Khuman" 
2 CONT
2 CONT The impact of Khuman's valiant defence of Chittor, from Muslim invaders, is felt for over three hundred years. The state of Mewar proves to be invincible, repelling the aggressors, forcing them to find other routes into the heartl
2 CONC and of the country. 
2 CONT
2 CONT A period of consolidation and growth dawns. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The descendants of Khuman strengthen the territorial integrity of the state of Mewar. New estates and principalities are carved out by the Guhilot Kings. The power and prestige of Chittor is on the ascendant.
