1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rana Raimal (1473–1509) was a ruler of Mewar. Maharana Raimal was the son of Maharana Kumbha. He came to power by defeating his patricide predecessor, Udaysingh I in battles at Jawar, Darimpur and Pangarh. Early in
2 CONC  Raimal's reign, Ghiyas Shah of Malwa attacked Chittor unsuccessfully
