1 NOTE {geni:about_me} **Mir Qamar-ud-din Khan (Asaf Jah I)**, also known as **Nizam-ul-Mulk**, was related to **Alamgir II** (the Mughal Emperor) in a **political and familial** context, though not by direct immediate family relationshi
