1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maulana Sa’adat Yaar Khan (fl. mid-18th century) was a military leader and regional governor during the late Mughal period. He was the son of Maulana Sa’eedullah Khan and the father of Maulana Muhammad Azam Khan. S
2 CONC a’adat Yaar Khan is known for his conquest of Rohilkhand and his appointment as governor of the region, marking a high point in the family’s political and military influence.
2 CONT
