1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maharaja Ratan Singh who was born in S. 1885 (A.D. 1728) succeeded his father Maharaja Surat Singh on Baisakh Bad 5'h S. 1885 (A.D. 1728). Immediately on his succession to the Gaddi, a dispute arose with the Bhatis
2 CONC  of Jaisalmer, as the latter had carried off camels belonging to the Bikaner Darbar.
