1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JDURING THE FIRST WAR OF INDEPENDENCE (1857) BECAME ORPHAN WHEN A CHILD AS HIS FATHER WAS HANGED TO DEATH BY THE BRITISH;JOINED SERVICE AS MUNSIF IN HYDERABAD WHERE LATER ON APPOINTED AS NAZIM (ADMINISTRATOR)& AMIR
2 CONC -_E_MAZAHIB,RESIGNED ON GROUND OF HEALTH ON 16 ZIKAD 1303=1886 & RETURNED TO DELHI WHERE REGAINED HEALTH INVITED BY NAWAB OF TONK (A MUSLIM RULER IN THOSE PERIODS WHO HELD SYMPATHY FOR MUSLIMS)AND APPOINTED NAZIM OF NIMHERA WHICH 
2 CONC ALSO RESIGNED IN 1915 AS HIS ELDEST DAUGHTER MOHAMMADI BEGUM ,HIS FAVORITE,WAS UNWELL & SHE WANTED HER ABBA TO BE NEAR HER;ONE HOBBY WAS TO CALLIGRAPH QURANIC "AYATS" IN SHAPE OF FLOWERS,WHICH ARE WITH HIS GRANDSON,HAYAT YAR KHAN;
2 CONC SO FOND OF "ITARS" (HERBAL SCENTS) THAT IT COULD BE KNOWN HE HAS PASSED THE PLACE FOR HE PUT LOTS OF ITAR & WHEN HE DIED HIS ALIMIRAH WAS FULL WITH ITAR BOTTLES;ALSO FOND OF DRESSES AND LEFT LOTS OF THEM;SINCE HIS FATHER & UNCLE W
2 CONC ERE HANGED TO DEATH AT KOTWALI,DELHI BY THE BRITISH DURING NATIONAL UPRISING LED BY BAHADUR SHAH ZAFAR AGAINST THEM,IN 1857,THERE WAS SEVERE PERSECUTION OF MUSLIMS AVOIDED COMING TO DELHI;LIKED 'HOOKAHS' AND FOND OF COFFEE;LOVING 
2 CONC HUSBAND COMBED & STYLED HAIR OF WIFE IN COURT-YARD OF HIS RESIDENCE"AFZAL MANZIL"(NOW 5182,BALLIMARAN,DELHI);HIS PROPERTY,5196 BALLIMARAN WAS BUILT BY HIM AND AT ITS ENTRANCE THE EVENT IS ENGRAVED ON RED SAND STONE.HE ALLAH BAKSHE
2 CONC Y WAS SO FOND OF "ITTARS" THAT PEOPLE KNEW FROM THE FRAGRANCE IF HE HAD PASSED FROM THAT AREA.HOLY PROPHET MUHAMMAD (P.B.U.H) WAS VERY FOND OF "ITTARS" ABBA NARRATED TO ME EACH MORNING HE RECITED AYAT UL QURSI & DAROOD SHARIF NUMB
2 CONC ER OF TIMES.
