1 NOTE {geni:about_me} SEVEN YEARS OF AGE WHEN FATHER DIED;MOTHER'S FIRST COUSIN HAKIM GHULAM KIBRIYA KHAN "BHOOREY MIAN" BECAME GUARDIAN;STUDIED IN MADARSA MAZHAR-UL-ISLAM,FRASHKHANA,DELHI & ANGLO-ARABIC SCHOOL;B.A. FROM ST.STEPHEN'S CO
2 CONC LLEGE AND LL.B FROM DELHI UNIVERSITY;WAS JUNIOR OF RAI  BAHADUR RAM KISHORE,SENIOR ADVOCATE,DARIBA KALAN,DELHI;AT THE AGE OF ABOUT 31 WAS A DEFENCE COUNSEL IN THE FAMOUS INDIAN NATIONAL ARMY (I.N.A.)TRIAL HELD AT RED FORT,DELHI DU
2 CONC RING THE BRITISH RULE IN INDIA;FAMOUS LAWYERS,INCLUDING,JAWAHAR LAL NEHRU,ASIF ALI,BHULABHAI DESAI WERE IN THE INA DEFENCE COMMITTEE SET UP BY INDIAN NATIONAL CONGRESS;ALSO MEMBER OF VARIOUS LEGAL COMMITTEES OF PROMINENT NATIONAL 
2 CONC & STATE INSTITUTIONS,LIKE REFUGEE RELIEF (INDIAN NATIONAL CONGRESS),JAMIA MILLIA ISLAMIA,FATEHPURI MUSLIM SECONDARY SCHOOL,JAMIAT-E-ULEMA-I-HIND,BACHON-KA-GHAR(ITS CHAIRMAN TILL DEATH AND MADE BEST CONTRIBUTION IN SETTING UP MECHA
2 CONC NICAL TRAINING SCHOOL,COMPUTER SCHOOL & RENOVATION OF MASJID THERE));CONGRESS PARTY CANDIDATE FROM BALLIMARAN WAS ELECTED MEMBER OF DELHI LEGISLATIVE ASSEMBLY(1952-56);DUE TO HIS INCORRUPTIBLE MANNERS HE AROUSED DISSENT AMONGST CO
2 CONC RRUPT POLITICIANS IN HIS CONGRESS PARTY AND THEY HATCHED A CONSPIRACY TO REQUEST HIM TO CONTEST DELHI MUNICIPAL CORPORATION ELECTION IN 1956-57 & BETRAYED  HIM  TO BE DEFEATED;LEADING MUSLIM ADVOCATE EXPERT ON CUSTODIAN CASES OR E
2 CONC VACUEE PROPERTY ACT;JAMIAT-I-ULEMA-I-HIND'S GENERAL SECRETARY MAULANA HIFZ-UR-REHMAN TOOK LEGAL SERVICES TO SETTLE U.P. MUSLIMS IN OLD DELHI AFTER MIGRATION OF LARGE NUMBER OF DELHI MUSLIMS TO PAKISTAN;PERSUADED MIGRATING MUSLIMS 
2 CONC TO STAY BACK;PRESIDENT FAKHRUDDIN ALI AHMED TOOK HIM ALONGWITH  IN HELICOPTER TO DAR-UL-ULOOM,DEOBAND TO DISCUSS THE ISSUE OF COMPULSORY 'STERILISATION' (BIRTH CONTROL);ANGUISHED WITH TEARS HE SAW & HEARD NEWS ON T.V. OF THE DEMOL
2 CONC ITION OF BABRI MASJID(6TH DEC.1992);NEVER TOOK MORE THAN TWO CHAPPATIS AT ONE MEAL;WORE SHERWANIS TO ATTEND COURTS AND ALSO FUNCTIONS AND ALSO ADHERED TO DRESS CODE IN HIGH COURT;WAS PUNCTUAL(BOTH MORNING & EVENING) IN HIS PRIVATE
2 CONC  LAWYER'S CHAMBER;WAS LAWYER FOR HIS FIRST COUSIN,HAKIM MOHAMMAD HAKIM (AKHA HAKIM)SECOND COUSIN,HAKIM MEHMOOD SAEED,IN-LAWS,NAWAB KHUSRO MIRZA,ALIMAH BEGUM,AYESHA BEGUM ...TOLD HIS FATHER WAS PUNCTUAL IN RECITING AYAT-UL-KURSI & 
2 CONC DUROOD SHARIF MANY TIMES EACH MORNING;NEVER MISSED HIS "CHAST" NAMAZ;ADVISED IN HIS LAST DAYS TO HIS YOUNGEST SON,NAVED,TO VISIT DARGAHS OF HAZRAT MOINUDDIN CHISTI AT AJMER & HAZRAT SALIM CHISTI AT FATEHPUR-SIKRI,AGRA.THE ADVISE W
2 CONC AS COMPLIED WITH AFTER HIS DEATH.HE WAS A CO-LAWYER IN ASSOCIATED ADVISERS ALONGWITH WITH MR. SANTOSH CHATTERJEE,ADVOCATE AT REGAL BUILDING,CONNAUGHT PLACE,NEW DELHI.DELHI OFFICE OF CUSTODIAN CASES IS FULL OF CASES WON BY HIM FOR 
2 CONC HIS MUSLIM CLIENTS.
2 CONT  Qur'anic Treasures Hidden in Surah Ikhlas (Purity) (Holy Qur'an 112:1-4)
2 CONT
2 CONT Surah Fatiha (The Opening Chapter) of the Holy Qur'an is the important Surah of the Holy Qur'an and no Muslim prayer is complete without it. It is therefore the most repeated Surah of the Holy Qur'an. After the Surah Fatiha, Surah
2 CONC  Ikhlas is the most important and most often repeated Surah of the Holy Qur'an. The importance of this Surah has been described in the following hadith of the Holy Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him)1: 
2 CONT
2 CONT "He (Abud Darda) reported God's messenger as saying, "Is any of you capable of reciting a third of the Qur'an in a night?" On being asked how they could recite a third of the Qur'an he replied, " 'Say, He is God, One' is equivalen
2 CONC t to a third of the Qur'an." Muslim transmitted it, and Bukhari transmitted it from Abu Sa'id."
2 CONT
2 CONT .May Allah be pleased with this statement & reward Abba's soul,which left us 17 years ago on this day..
2 CONT
2 CONT 	My father,(late) Mr.Sultan Yar Khan, Advocate was a defense counsel in the famous INA Trial held during the British rule in India and due to his constant and dedicated selfless services to the people he was the first elected cand
2 CONC idate from Ballimaran Assembly constituency to the first Delhi Legislative Assembly..My father was Congressman but since the infamous events during the Emergency era he began to drift away from the party and I saw tears in his eye
2 CONC s when during the Congress rule at the Centre Babri Masjid was demolished in open daylight. He died on Jumma,17 Muharram,1416 A.H.
