2 NOTE Muhammad Sultan Yar Khan (Born 1914 died on Friday 16th June 1995) Advocate, in 1951 First elected Member from Ballimaran assembly constituency to the first Delhi State Legisltive Assembly; at the age of 30 he along with Barrister
3 CONC  Asif Ali,Pt. Jawahar Lal Nehru was Defence Counsel in the famous Indian National Army (INA) Trial held a...t Red Fort Delhi in 1945 during the British rule in India.He was also President of Delhi Municipal Committee,legal advisor
3 CONC  of various well repute institutions like Jamia Millia Islamia, Jamiat-i-ulema-i-hind;member of various organizations-Delhi Wakf Board,Fatehpur Muslim Senior Secondary School.Renowned lawyer for custodian cases.Chairman of Bachon 
3 CONC ka ghar( renowned Muslim orphanage at Darya Ganj,Delhi patronized by ambassadors of Kuwait,Saudi Arabia,UAE in India. On 16th June 2011 is his 16th death anniversary, you are requested to pray for peace of his soul.
