1 NOTE {geni:about_me} eldest amongst five children of my parents;my father called me "Florence of nightingale";Nawab Agha Syed Amjad Ali Shah, my nana (maternal grandfather) used to,when I was young, make us practice oratory standing in
2 CONC front of mirror;also to pick up mangoes by putting mouth in the fountain-pond;he encouraged education amongst his granddaughters,he was a reformer; my father used to take us for walks,he himself daily walked from Old Delhi to Indi
2 CONC a Gate having tea in garden of Imperial Hotel,Janpath on the way.I ensured my children had uniform ready and prepared to reach school/s in time.I was punctual in reciting 'Holy Quran' in mornings.Died on Jumma, 28 Rabbi-ul-Sani,14
2 CONC 14 A.H.
