1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maharaja Dungar Singh (22 August 1854 – 19 August 1887) was a Maharaja of the princely state of Bikaner from 1872 to 1887. The eldest of three sons of Maharaj Sri Lal Singh (16 December 1831-17 September 1887) a re
2 CONC lative of a distant branch of the Rathore clan, Dungar Singh was an enlightened and progressive monarch.
