1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MD/CEO FABCON PVT. LTD
2 CONT
2 CONT Fabcon (Pvt. ) Ltd. Was established in January 1984, by the undersigned after serving various National and International Companies at senior technical and management positions. Having gained substansive experience of management an
2 CONC d execution of technically intensive projects such as Oil Refineries, Thermal Power Stations, Dams and Pre- Engineered Steel Structures, the management rapidly achieved success in the field of High Voltage Transmission Lines/Grid 
2 CONC Stations.
2 CONT
2 CONT As the Company stands today it has established itself as one of the leading companies specializing in the civil works for 500 Kv & 220 Kv Transmission Lines and is sought after by all the prime contractors in this field. Over the 
2 CONC years we have executed projects for construction companies like M/S. ICC, Greaves Cotton, CWE (China) to name a few under the supervision of Consultants like M/S Nespak, Fithchner (Germany), Marubeni (Japan) etc.
2 CONT
2 CONT With time Fabcon has managed to equip itself to a wide range of techniques in order to deal with various terrains across Pakistan such as the dynamite grading of barren mountains of Sibi- Loralai to the piling work and elevated ti
2 CONC e beam construction in the river bed of Chenab. These challenges allow us to branch out into other fields of construction such as road works, pipe laying, bridge manufacturing etc.
2 CONT
2 CONT Consequently we have established a quantum of tools, equipment and a pool of skilled manpower. These are listed separately for your perusal and can be enlarged to suit the requirements of the projects as and when required.
2 CONT
2 CONT Based on our experience we feel confident of taking over any construction related project and keeping with the commitment synonymous to our name, safely & successfully completing it.
