1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maharajdhiraj Mirza Maharao Sri Khengarji III Sawai Bahadur, GCSI, GCIE, KIH was a progressive and enlightened Maharao of the Indian Princely State of Cutch from 1875 to 1942. He ascended the throne in 1875 after d
2 CONC emise of his father Maharao Shri Pragmalji II of Kutch. A member of the Jadeja clan of Rajputs, he advanced his state drastically over the sixty-six years of his reign, modernising it and bringing it forth into the 20th century...
