1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Renowned for Welfare  & Social Work.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1893, [http://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Mohammed-Akbar-Hydari/6000000007722963624/ Sir Mohammed Akbar bin Nazar Ali Hydari] married his cousin, the daughter of the Oriental scholar, [http://www.geni.com/people/Al-Haj-Mulla-Najmud
2 CONC din-Tyabji/6000000011253403134/ Haji Mulla Najmuddin Tyabji]. Lady Hydari had been [http://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Mohammed-Akbar-Hydari/6000000007722963624/ Sir Akbar Hydari's] right hand in his social and educational work & took
2 CONC  great interest in female education in Hyderabad, and in the progress of the women of the State. In 1908 she received the ''Kaiser-i-Hind'' medal for her work during the ''River Musa Flood'' tragedy.
2 CONT
